    dcterms:creator orcid:0000-0002-8113-9419 ;
    dcterms:description "EVENTSKG release 3.0: metadata of 2531 events of 75 top-ranked computer-science event series (1969-2026): dates, location, homepage, submitted/accepted papers and acceptance rate, research field, publisher and sponsor."@en ;
